  {
    "date_created": "2025-07-01T11:27:47.247Z",
    "date_updated": "2025-07-21T14:41:39.857Z",
    "id": "4",
    "name_not_used": "LODGING-EVENT HOSTING-EVENT ORGANIZATION",
    "status": "published",
    "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
    "user_updated": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278",
    "accordion_items": [
      {
        "accordion_id": "4",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0)\">The guest house offers 30 beds distributed in 2 double rooms and 5 dormitories.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline button\" href=\"/category/guesthouse\">Read More</a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline button\" href=\"/page/accommodation\">Book Now</a></p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T11:30:03.166Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-21T14:38:23.479Z",
        "header": "LODGING",
        "id": "6",
        "main_image": "496f4b23-4e16-47f7-a508-5c270e7aaea2",
        "sort": "-2",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "4",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">The Hub hosts events such as work retreats, conferences, festivals, or weddings. For medium or big events, accommodation is reserved for event participants.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">We also provide an Event Playbook to all event organizers free of charge that supports event planning through templates for time management, content creation and economic calculation.</p><p style=\"text-align: left\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline button\" href=\"/category/event-location\">Read More</a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-blue-600 underline button\" href=\"/page/venue\">Book Now</a></p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T11:31:13.093Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-21T14:38:39.043Z",
        "header": "EVENT HOSTING",
        "id": "7",
        "main_image": "f6e38335-40a6-4b4c-bfc3-6471c067c38f",
        "sort": "-1",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "258593a6-4999-4401-8ea6-5959100f1278"
      },
      {
        "accordion_id": "4",
        "content": "<p style=\"text-align: left\">If you have an idea for an event but only limited capacity to organise it, we got your back. Be it a hackathon, an (un)conference, or a retreat – we have long-standing experience in running events and are happy to help you bring your vision to life.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align: left\">Our services range from conceptual planning to practical event preparation, running the event itself and wrap-up. In addition, we have a wide range of professionals we can draw on, be it facilitators, conflict mediators, media teams, yoga teachers or meditation guides.</p>",
        "date_created": "2025-07-01T11:32:03.433Z",
        "date_updated": "2025-07-01T11:51:20.541Z",
        "header": "EVENT ORGANIZATION",
        "id": "8",
        "main_image": "c613c2dc-48fb-4d88-b3e6-243be43655c7",
        "sort": "-1",
        "user_created": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5",
        "user_updated": "67202695-054e-48ad-8402-56f3a03c38c5"
      }
    ],
